promoters</article-title><source>Trends in Plant Science</source><year>2005</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>88</fpage><lpage>94</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15708346</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.tplants.2004.12.012</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>